Package: wowordcount
Type: Package
Title: LIWC-style Word Count Analyses
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Gabriele", "Di Cicco", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "gabriele.dicicco@gmail.com")
Description: LIWC-style word count analysis for jamovi. Counts the full
    document frequency of each matched term per category from
    user-supplied dictionaries.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: jmvcore (>= 2.4), R6, stats
Suggests: jsonlite, testthat
